      "side": 1,
      "message": "or_insert_with inserts a value when a key-value pair does not exist in the hashmap. When the required key exists in the hashmap, it does nothing and simply returns the existing value. \n\nand_modify returns a mutable reference to the value if it exists.\n\nWithout and_modify, each time we call set_battery_info, this function won\u0027t change the value of battery_set if it already exists.",
